    "type": "text",
    "text": "While speaking on the Hall of Fame podcast , Booker T reacted to Sol Ruca’s Women’s Intercontinental Championship match against Becky Lynch at Clash in Italy. Ruca walked out with the title after hitting the Sol Snatcher , but Booker felt the match exposed one major area she still needs to improve."
